      "en": "This is the offering which you shall take from them: gold, silver, bronze,",
      "ko": "너희가 그들에게서 받을 예물은 이러하니 금과 은과 놋과",
      "source_text_hash": "c312afba30e9b51ba1551673c2f6d1ebe9675a35b0b5918d6aeb4f462dcf3f52",
      "translation_text_hash": "0ba943a5b35df3630906e90d9143ac221b053b6571f8e0d84183ea0e7fde3b3a",
