      "ko": "호마노며 에봇과 흉패에 물릴 보석이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2244d42d433411b7a401dbf758522be944f3759cec74c229803ed6e95c315935",
      "translation_text_hash": "88953de6903016e368418762b6ddef7e4101d69579a488804abf9c27651c0a40",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
