        }
      ],
      "en": "You shall make two cherubim of hammered gold. You shall make them at the two ends of the mercy seat.",
      "ko": "금으로 그룹 둘을 속죄소 두 끝에 쳐서 만들되",
      "source_text_hash": "4a1fb44ef3e51d79dd61771c0ed579157d27301697eb17d69a269bafc9b21d34",
      "translation_text_hash": "ead674300f376af58b4e3288b5eaad354076d7d9a7604e879ec3c8676afecaae",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "금으로 그룹 둘을 속죄소 두 끝에 쳐서 만들되"
