      "en": "You shall overlay it with pure gold, and make a gold molding around it.",
      "ko": "정금으로 싸고 주위에 금테를 두르고",
      "source_text_hash": "de1b8d6854fb64b83b9f671b75ce6eaed5f97c18af24bd05f396fc506fbe4b12",
      "translation_text_hash": "bea692622374baa090614998110d9772dd8a7c8f521e6570564ebc618d8196d6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "정금으로 싸고 주위에 금테를 두르고"
