      "en": "You shall make four rings of gold for it, and put the rings in the four corners that are on its four feet.",
      "ko": "그것을 위하여 금고리 넷을 만들어 그 네 발위 네 모퉁이에 달되",
      "source_text_hash": "1e1a0c311dccc8124ddef2518d20f90e302bc461edf243b287ef7c8f894b45c8",
